  "solution": {
    "text": "(i) Case <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>7</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder></math><br />at places marked <math><mi>X</mi><mo>,</mo></math> we can place&nbsp;<math><mn>0</mn></math> to <math><mn>9</mn><mo>,</mo></math> except <math><mn>7</mn><mo>,</mo></math> in <math><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>9</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup></math> ways<br />(ii) Case <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#921;</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow><mi>X</mi></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow><mn>7</mn></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><munder underaccent=\"false\"><mrow><mi>Y</mi></mrow><mo>_</mo></munder></math><br />If <math><mn>7</mn></math> is at some other place, first place marked <math><mi>X</mi></math> can be filled in <math><mn>8</mn></math> ways ( <math><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math><mn>7</mn></math> not allowed) and places marked <math><mi>Y</mi></math> can be filled in <math><mn>9</mn></math> ways. <math><mn>7</mn></math> can be placed at any of the four places in&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>4</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mn>8</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>9</mn><mn>3</mn></msup></math>&nbsp;ways<br /><math><mo>&#8658;</mo></math> Required number of ways <math><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>32</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></math><math><mo>=</mo><mn>41</mn><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mn>9</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mo>.</mo></math>"
